On Nov 6, 7:40=A0pm, Pat Rankin <ran...@pactechdata.com> wrote:
> I haven't seen anyone else mention that one possible
> result of sitting on a throne is, "You are granted an insight!"
> That's approximately equivalent to reading a blessed scroll
> of identify (one of the minor differences being that it won't
